  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_ab4f48e87b5d44b79583d55c86f35b80",
      "statement": "FIONAA separates checkpointed graph state from runtime context: `ApplicationState` holds serializable workflow data, while `AgentContext` carries invocation-scoped collaborators such as `ApplicationStore`, `PolicyDocStore`, and live tools that are intentionally excluded from checkpoints.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://fionaa/app/fionaa/graph.py#L546-L556",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b4b95bd801e2467fc8f5657e3e90d666f2c772b8738ed69ac84f4203bdc4b0de:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://fionaa/app/fionaa/schemas.py#L166-L205",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e2efc20bc2fcaf60c88812b63746ec6a31c3f7d46a243a06a7d2edcbe0259182:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_83650c4fa5134706907bc4245bd39f80",
      "statement": "The application form is validated by `ApplicationFormSchema`, which covers applicant, company, lending, operating, and director-control fields; the schema enforces non-negative bounds on fields such as `loan_amount`, `loan_term`, `annual_turnover`, and several expense values while allowing economically meaningful negatives like `annual_profit` and `balance`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://fionaa/app/fionaa/schemas.py#L25-L93",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9185a493351bb97f1b4670611941100719e9f6ed9a2b8789cee62b83b1551773:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7b607f7a5f0945dbbbfdcfb5acba68a5",
      "statement": "`load_application` reads `input/application.json`, discovers staged documents by prefix under `input/`, validates each document against its schema, and fails the run on missing or invalid JSON instead of silently dropping bad evidence.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://fionaa/app/fionaa/graph.py#L154-L191",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f34fa2b801ea3fb70db197180737b5f8041e90a42ec287beb7f12dffb3f1e6fd:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://fionaa/app/fionaa/tests/test_graph.py#L81-L153",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8411045cdb2eb2aafd8e850d2fa386925a2397adf3392321ba0e3e99540695fe:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cffdb91b7f714a7bbde81c3560e32026",
      "statement": "The staged financial documents are canonical list-valued state fields: `annual_accounts` uses `AnnualAccountsSchema` and `bank_statements` uses `BankStatementSchema`, and the loader supports multiple documents of each type.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://fionaa/app/fionaa/graph.py#L148-L191",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:791ba1957acec7dba422af8168fb50040ddad1ca34d6bbd1c96eda70e549b16d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://fionaa/app/fionaa/schemas.py#L71-L136",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d9520e1b23b6bde455991274c4cd5528f1b6ee58c3620a146d4a8d8a755ec0b5:"
