    {
      "id": "claim_0890a4a1936648d99eb7bb59d1298b40",
      "statement": "`CompaniesHouseResult` is the branch-driving verification shape: `found` controls whether the graph continues to financial assessment or terminates at `reject_no_company`, and the persisted evidence includes redacted tool calls plus groundedness metadata that can downgrade unsupported positive matches to `found=False`.",
