    {
      "id": "claim_8fd499433c5149d4b3a0cb437da66f96",
      "statement": "`FinancialAssessmentResult` carries a deterministic cross-check, repayment and affordability fields, and narrative discrepancies; the cross-check comparisons are computed in code and copied into the model response rather than re-derived by the model.",
