    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7f564d6af6664bb2851aa96cacd775f3",
      "statement": "The graph has a single conditional branch on Companies House verification; all other edges are linear, and the rejection path writes the terminal decision artifact immediately while the success path always continues through financial assessment, web search, and synthesized decision.",
